{"id":"verdad","lemma":"verdad","pos":"noun","rank":70,"glosses":["truth","fact"],"ipa":"/beɾˈda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"verdades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-verdad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él sabe la verdad.","en":"He knows the truth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/525442","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ellos saben la verdad.","en":"They know the truth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77111","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Llegó el momento de la verdad.","en":"The moment of truth has arrived.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594850","words":[{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"moment, instant"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Nunca has oído de mí, ¿verdad?","en":"You've never heard of me, have you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515063","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"hearing"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"me"},null]},{"text":"Parece que nadie sabe la verdad.","en":"It seems that no one knows the truth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609705","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}